    "description": "The Cold Stone Creamery\u00ae app lets you order our made-fresh Ice Cream in a Creation\u2122, Shake or Cake and have it ready for pickup at your favorite store or delivered right to your door! Sign in to your My Cold Stone Rewards account and you can save favorite orders, earn points and redeem rewards! \r\n\r\nABOUT MY COLD STONE CLUB REWARDS\r\n+ Earn 1 point for every $1\r\n+ Receive a $5 Reward with every 50 points \r\n+ Enjoy a Buy One, Get One FREE on your birthday\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n+ Order ahead and pick up at the store \r\n+ Or, get your order delivered right to your door\r\n+ Easily re-order with favorites and recent orders\r\n+ Enjoy The Ultimate Ice Cream Experience\u00ae in app with unlimited customizations",
